    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Pirate Cat in an endless runner adventure like no other! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Sail through the jungle in a makeshift box-boat, collecting coins and unlocking special bonuses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Navigate through rune gates to gain unique powers and gather various collectibles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>FEATURES</u>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tExciting Jungle Setting: Explore vibrant jungle landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tCollect Coins: Gather coins to unlock special abilities and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tRune Gates: Pass through rune gates to gain unique powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tFun Collectibles: Discover and collect various items to enhance your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tEndless Fun: Keep running and exploring for as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the adventure and see how far you can sail with Kato Pirato!</strong></p>",
